### Execution Format
Use both `GIT_COMMITTER_*` environment variables and `--author` flag:
```bash
GIT_COMMITTER_NAME="<NAME>" GIT_COMMITTER_EMAIL="<EMAIL>" git commit --author="<NAME> <<EMAIL>>" -m "<MESSAGE>"
```
